                <div class="about-cta-glow"></div>


                <span class="about-label">
                    GET STARTED
                </span>


                <h2>
                    Ready to work with your image?
                </h2>


                <p>
                    Choose an ImageForge tool and get started.
                </p>


                <div class="about-cta-actions">

                    <!-- Opens converter separately -->

